The {{Term/Store|Well-Worn Outfit||Series, BotW}} is an [[Armor Set]] in {{BotW}}.<ref name="CaC 179"/>

==Location and Uses==
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Well-Worn Outfit consists of the [[Old Shirt]] and the [[Well-Worn Trousers]], both of which are noted to be too small for [[Link]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="BotW Inventory 2"/> Both pieces of [[Armor]] can be found in stone [[Treasure Chest]]s within the [[Shrine of Resurrection]]. While the Well-Worn Outfit cannot be upgraded by a [[Great Fairy]], Link is able to [[Hateno Dye|Dye]] its pieces at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. After completing the "[[From the Ground Up]]" [[Side Quest]], [[Granté]] will begin to sell the pieces of the Well-Worn Outfit in [[Tarrey Town]].

